title: After each plan, before the next
pid: 327204f2-c749-4cda-92c7-a770f5cdf465
body: |2-
  Run a short review with two questions, by one agent: what terms did
  this plan's code coin or reuse, and does its code cite anything under
  'TODO/'. Run, by a second agent in parallel, a probe pass: each
  behavior of the plan's "Agreed behavior", driven end to end against
  an isolated server (the verify skill says how), with what was sent
  and received recorded. In plan 04.1 and again in plan 2_2 the one
  regression every suite missed was found by a probe. Vocabulary drift ("drawn", "fresh", "leaf") and plan
  citations in code each entered through one plan and spread through
  the next; both are cheap to catch per plan and expensive to catch at
  the end. The full post-mortem method is in 'code-reviews.org'.
